# Model API image: the approved versions only. Transitive packages are resolved by services/model_api/compile_lock.sh into requirements.txt and listed at lock
# review. The pins below are the ones another image of this project already fixes (the MLflow client of the server version, Feast and its stores, NumPy). The model
# libraries and the web stack carry no project pin yet, so the first lock compile chooses them. The compile then fails when one of the model libraries differs from
# the training image lock (services/training/requirements.txt), because a model saved with one scikit-learn or XGBoost release is not safe to load with another.
